{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-05/1063369/block/singleImage/3265016/df/01KR939XHJ8E6NZHX09XH6YJK4.jpg?updatedAt=1794451840\"/><figcaption>聯合醫院。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>秀茂坪發生街頭襲擊案。 今日（12日）早上7時27分，一名女子在曉光街42號一大廈升降機出口近梯級旁邊，突然遭3名大漢襲擊，當中有人持木棍向她狂毆，兇徒得手後逃去。女子負傷自行報警求助。警方和救援人員接報後到場，發現她身體多處受傷，右手骨折，由救護車將她送往聯合醫院治理。警方正在調查事件，追緝兇徒歸案。消息指，遇襲女子和兇徒均為南亞裔人士，懷疑事件涉及感情糾紛。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T03:43:55.072539+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":194,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T02:50:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T09:37:25.111197+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T03:37:16.292737+00:00","content_hash":"d43bf17c622f979cf145630f42dd327458198ce899f9ebf27c9239e99bcb05c8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T03:43:55.072539+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}